            {
              "ref": "A15",
              "type": "str",
              "value": "Key refinement: the evidence now supports TWO COMPLEMENTARY 12-state axes, but from different sources. Late Babylonian triplicities natively instantiate the mod-4/augmented axis; Numbers and Sethian natively instantiate block 4×3 matrices whose transpose exposes the mod-3/diminished axis only partially. Music is the one system where both axes are exact and intrinsic.",
              "raw_value": "Key refinement: the evidence now supports TWO COMPLEMENTARY 12-state axes, but from different sources. Late Babylonian triplicities natively instantiate the mod-4/augmented axis; Numbers and Sethian natively instantiate block 4×3 matrices whose transpose exposes the mod-3/diminished axis only partially. Music is the one system where both axes are exact and intrinsic.",
