              "formula": null,
              "formula_attributes": null,
              "style": "60"
            },
            {
              "ref": "B19",
              "type": "str",
              "value": "Secret collaboration is currently unsupported; genuine polemic and adversarial co-development both fit the evidence well. A partially performative polemic remains possible but requires positive private evidence.",
