            {
              "ref": "A15",
              "type": "str",
              "value": "Dependency-corrected conclusion: the substantive cross-lineage observation is not 'five systems independently converge on216.' It is that the independently interesting 27-fold Vedic lattice and the already-central 72-fold Shem/quinance lattice close exactly at216. This is a legitimate comparison trigger, but smooth-number nulls show it is not rare enough to carry a common-origin claim by itself.",
              "raw_value": "Dependency-corrected conclusion: the substantive cross-lineage observation is not 'five systems independently converge on216.' It is that the independently interesting 27-fold Vedic lattice and the already-central 72-fold Shem/quinance lattice close exactly at216. This is a legitimate comparison trigger, but smooth-number nulls show it is not rare enough to carry a common-origin claim by itself.",
