          "char_start": 328379,
          "char_end": 329176,
          "position_basis": "UTF8-sig decoded Unicode code points and physical LF lines; raw source bytes retained",
          "exact_quote": "| Retained result | Consequence for subsequent work |\n|---|---|\n| A person’s position is anchored under a specified adapter | Related placements must respect that anchor or identify the exact assumption they challenge. |\n| An event is identified as succession rather than generation | Candidate operators must preserve the relevant identities and ancestry. |\n| A projection requires a remainder to preserve closure | Later representations must carry that remainder or explicitly accept the lost information. |\n| Two constructions remain possible | Work proceeds with two alternatives and their known difference—not with an unrestricted search. |\n| A relationship is established only in one witness | Its consequences remain attached to that witness rather than silently governing every version. |\n",
          "quote_sha256": "e5fc56af5e4455e4d0376a37a1ec7f748935b9aa8e78ab7c310cbb8871799043",
          "message_id": "cdfb068ececc079b3905576279317d9384aa02708a738111ffa6d9289429a06f",
