          "line_end": 7146,
          "char_start": 364990,
          "char_end": 365500,
          "position_basis": "UTF8-sig decoded Unicode code points and physical LF lines; raw source bytes retained",
          "exact_quote": "| Human account | Mathematical musical consequence |\n|---|---|\n| Moses carries responsibility for the people without being their biological parent. | A governing or supporting relationship must not become a biological-generation edge. |\n| Existing elders are brought into shared responsibility. | Selection and participation do not create new entities. |\n| The burden is to be shared with Moses. | This passage does not enact his replacement. Succession and shared orchestration remain different operations. |\n",
          "quote_sha256": "9bb10567a4e1fe2e5883e7b685ec598bb6da5b2ef6206f0c3b9284c1fd10f8dc",
