          "Sethian $4\\times3$ and Valentinian half×role are transposes of one grid",
          "**No transpose.** Fails at position 6: Sethian (2,3) = Memory; Valentinian position 6 = Agape. Also fails at (2,1): Sethian first member of Oroiael is **Pronoia** in Waldstein–Wisse, **Epinoia/Afterthought** in other translations — variant-labeled, not collated",
