          "\"Chaos → Gaia, Tartarus, Eros\"",
          "**Split:** GR1a Chaos first appears; GR1b Chaos → Erebus, Nyx (explicit); GR1c Gaia, Tartarus, Eros follow but are **not explicitly children of Chaos** in *Theogony* 116–138",
