          "Sophia at (4,3) generates Cronus at (4,3)",
          "**Address match only:** Sophia 12th aeon (Sethian, under stated ordering); Cronus 12th Titan (Hesiodic enumeration). Generation withdrawn",
          "Apocryphon long rec.; Hesiod *Theogony* 453–458, 137–138",
          "**Candidate positional overlap; generative edge unresolved**",
          "**Yes** — generative edge removed; positional overlap remains candidate"
        ],
        [
          "**Aether**",
          "Aether = Logos–Zoe boundary = Decad generator",
          "**Candidate functional correspondence only.** Logos–Zoe → Decad is fixed (I.1). Aether → Logos–Zoe crosswalk requires independent constraint. Nut ≠ Aether by identity",
          "Irenaeus I.1 (hostile, court-required); Hesiod *Theogony* 124–125; Aristotle *De Caelo*",
          "**Candidate**",
          "**No** — downgraded; not a hard constraint"
        ],
        [
          "**O9**",
          "23 = functional count; 24 = represented forms; seam doubling",
          "**Conditional.** $22+1=24-1=23$ arithmetic holds. No manuscript yields a unique 23rd functional class. Marcosian 9+8+7=24 **and** analogical double letters to 30 must both be preserved",
          "Irenaeus I.14.5 (reported); Sefer; falsification register §\"Distinct 22/23/24/30 constructions\"",
          "**Unresolved hypothesis**",
          "**Yes** — 23/24 removed from hard constraints; 30 added as required count to preserve"
        ],
        [
          "**O8**",
          "W72 must include per-row orientation bit for Shem reversal",
          "**Withdrawn.** Forward–backward–forward is applied before column extraction. W72 unchanged; existing $\\mathbb{Z}_2$ factor retains its defined role",
          "Exodus 14:19–21 tradition; Shem construction",
          "**Fixed source transformation; W72 unchanged**",
          "**No** — W72 unchanged"
        ]
