          "position_basis": "UTF8-sig decoded Unicode code points and physical LF lines; raw source bytes retained",
          "exact_quote": "| Apparent problem | Actual structure |\n|---|---|\n| 22 vs 24 Greek letters | Greek has 24 *letters* (vowels added). Sefer has 22 *letters*. Different alphabets, different counts. |\n| 22 vs 30 Marcosian | Marcosian's 30 is derived from 24 via the Episemon. Sefer's 30 is derived from 22 via doubles + Shin. Different derivations, same count. |\n| 231 vs 233 (Aleph activation) | 231 is letter pairs. 233 is letter pairs + 2 mediated activation contributions. Different operation. |\n| 210 (Aleph removed) | Deletion, not deactivation. Different count for a different operation. |\n",
          "quote_sha256": "6969008ed7ecb9de69931e58122e9ae0fdad5024d1656638df113a96e38202ff",
