      "headers": [
        "Record",
        "Required correction",
        "Consequence"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "**Ezekiel 37**",
          "The body's configuration changes before animation: scattered bones → assembled body → living body",
          "This is a **two-stage transformation**, not simply activation with structure unchanged"
        ],
        [
          "**Eldad–Medad**",
