          "position_basis": "UTF8-sig decoded Unicode code points and physical LF lines; raw source bytes retained",
          "exact_quote": "| Titan line | Descendants | Function carried into later generations |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| **Cronus + Rhea** | Hestia, Demeter, Hera, Hades, Poseidon, **Zeus** | Sovereignty, differentiated domains, succession |\n| **Coeus + Phoebe** | **Leto**, Asteria | Prophetic and oracular associations |\n| **Leto + Zeus** | **Apollo, Artemis** | Music, prophecy, lunar/hunting associations |\n| **Hyperion + Theia** | **Helios, Selene, Eos** | Sun, moon, dawn - differentiated light and timekeeping |\n| **Oceanus + Tethys** | River gods and Oceanids | Waters, circulation, boundaries |\n| **Iapetus + Clymene/Asia** | **Atlas, Prometheus, Epimetheus, Menoetius** | Support, forethought, afterthought, transmission of crafts |\n| **Crius + Eurybia** | Astraeus, Pallas, Perses | Astral and power-related descendant branches |\n| **Mnemosyne + Zeus** | **Nine Muses** | Memory expressed through artistic and poetic functions |\n| **Themis + Zeus** | Horae; Moirai in Hesiod's account | Order, seasons, justice, allotment |\n",
          "quote_sha256": "0e59453eef9dabb28b4a2066265e5a994eb69cb24c154faf489cd37c53816a00",
