      "rows": [
        [
          "**Saturn→Jupiter→Mars assigned to consecutive fifths**",
          "Musical transformation. Geocentric order is distance, not fifth generation. Cronus's anchor does not propagate to siblings."
        ],
        [
          "**\"Cronus is at 12\" without coordinate specification**",
          "Address. 12 could be planetary position (Saturn, yes), fifth-index (undetermined), or sounding address (undetermined). Must be typed."
        ],
        [
          "**Chinese pentatonic read as fifth-generation order**",
          "Musical transformation. C-D-E-G-A ≠ C-G-D-A-E. Two sequences, not one."
        ],
        [
          "**Aion placed anywhere in 0–12**",
          "Address. Aion is the frame; counting it as a constituent fails the \"encompassing whole\" test."
        ],
        [
          "**Any yin/yang orientation flip in a transformation**",
          "Inherited function. Must be explicitly marked as reversal, not silently absorbed."
        ]
