          "position_basis": "UTF8-sig decoded Unicode code points and physical LF lines; raw source bytes retained",
          "exact_quote": "| Symbol | Was | Corrected to | Basis |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Aleph** | First letter; value 1; Tarot = Magician (I) | **Reference/operator; zero-state; Tarot = Fool (0)** | Sefer 3: mediates Mem and Shin. SUN: $2/3$ is log-midpoint of $1/2$ and $8/9$. Operator role, not first-of-22. |\n| **Mem** | Water element, third mother | **$4/3$ reciprocal pole; pitch $8/9$; lowest** | SUN ratios under pitch-height convention |\n| **Shin** | Fire element, third mother | **$3/4$ reciprocal pole; pitch $1/2$; highest** | SUN ratios under pitch-height convention |\n| **The three mothers** | Three equivalent generators | **One reference + two reciprocal operations** | Exact: $(2/3)^2 = (1/2)(8/9)$; $3/4 \\cdot 4/3 = 1$ |\n| **231 gates** | The Sefer gate count | **Letter-pair count for 22 unweighted letters.** Activated/weighted count = **233**; covering count $N(12)$ = **233** | $231 = \\binom{22}{2}$; $233 = 231 + 2$ (Aleph's mediations) = $N(12)$ |\n| **Aleph-deleted count** | Confused with 231 | **210** = $\\binom{21}{2}$. Deletion ≠ deactivation | EMET→MET is deletion; activation toggle is separate |\n| **Yaldabaoth** | 13th note; higher octave | **Material bass entry; F_lower** | First mechanical sound requires bass; $(RL)^{-1}$ from F_upper |\n| **Sophia** | \"Fallen aeon\" | **Seam at 12/22/30; F_upper** | 12th Duodecad, 22nd Decad+Duodecad, 30th Pleroma |\n| **Sabaoth** | New Yaldabaoth | **C_lower, fifth above Yaldabaoth** | $R$ from F_lower = $3/2$ frequency = fifth up |\n| **Shem's middle reversal** | Same as mother reordering | **Involution (order 2) on middle row only** | $\\rho^2 = I$, distinct from 3-cycle mother order |\n| **Mother reordering** | \"Inversion\" | **3-cycle (order 3)** | $(\\text{Shin},\\text{Aleph},\\text{Mem}) \\to (\\text{Aleph},\\text{Mem},\\text{Shin})$, $\\pi^3 = I$ |\n| **Rahu–Ketu** | Two dark planets; one slot | **Opposite lunar nodes, 180° apart** | Eclipse geometry; ascending vs. descending |\n| **22 / 23 / 24** | One correct count | **Three counting levels: 22 letters, 27 graphic forms, 30 sound realizations** | 22 + 5 final forms = 27; 22 + 7 doubles + 1 Shin/Sin = 30 |\n| **7-headed dragon** | = 7 chakras | **7 heads + 10 horns + 7 diadems; must preserve all attributes** | Rev 12:3, 12:9; reduction to 7 loses structure |\n| **Lucifer** | = Satan | **Morning-star designation (Venus); used of Jesus (Rev 22:16); later moral reassignment** | Isaiah 14:12 *Helel*; 2 Pet 1:19 Vulgate; not originally Satan |\n| **Four triads / six syzygies** | Two competing organizations | **Both on the cube's 12 edges; flip-two involution preserves both** | Explicit construction verified |\n| **Chinese 8/10/12** | = Valentinian 8/10/12 | **Same counts, different operations** (trigrams vs. syzygies; stems vs. Decad; branches vs. Duodecad) | Operation types verified |\n| **Three 72s** | One structure | **Three operations: Shem (extraction), Sabaoth court (office), Goetia (catalogue)** | Equal population, different invariants |\n| **Three 6+6s** | One pattern | **Titans (unpaired), Cronus children (grouped FFF→MMM), Valentinian (alternating MF)** | Three distinct operations |\n| **Sabbath / Sabaoth** | Same word | **Different roots; 7→rest→8 functional sequence survives** | שַׁבָּת vs. צְבָאוֹת |\n| **Venus names** | Three mothers | **One identity, two manifestations (Phosphoros/Eosphoros = morning; Hesperos = evening)** | Astronomy |\n",
