          "position_basis": "UTF8-sig decoded Unicode code points and physical LF lines; raw source bytes retained",
          "exact_quote": "| Traversal | Final frequency ratio | C pitch class? | Exact $3/2$ endpoint? |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Immediate F→C | $3/2$ | Yes | Yes |\n| Octave down, then fifth | $3/4$ | Yes | No — different register |\n| Twelve pure fifths, uncorrected | $1594323/1048576$ | No | No |\n| Twelve fifths, comma correction, fifth | $3/2$ | Yes | Yes |\n| Corrected cycle, octave down, fifth | $3/4$ | Yes | No — different register |\n",
